        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-17T11:59:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is mandatory by [spec](https://microsoft.github.io/DirectX-Specs/d3d/archive/D3D11_3_FunctionalSpec.htm#5.6.1.3%20Map()%20on%20DEFAULT%20Buffers%20used%20as%20SRVs%20or%20UAVs). I don\u0027t think it\u0027s driver specific.\n\n\n```suggestion\n    // Default storage cannot be used with Vertex, Index or Indirect usage.\n    // See https://microsoft.github.io/DirectX-Specs/d3d/archive/D3D11_3_FunctionalSpec.htm#5.6.1.3%20Map()%20on%20DEFAULT%20Buffers%20used%20as%20SRVs%20or%20UAVs\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 94,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 95,
        "endChar": 60
      },
      "revId": "e0df4df7d866e68ebdfd9156d0a3edb333f5131a",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
