      },
      "lineNbr": 97,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-17T11:59:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should add a check for device-\u003eCanMapOnDefaultBuffer() here:\n\n```suggestion\n    DAWN_ASSERT(IsMappable(usage);\n    if (!device-\u003eCanMapOnDefaultBuffer()) {\n        return false;\n    }\n    if (usage \u0026 wgpu::BufferUsage::Uniform) {\n        return false;\n    }\n    // Move the above comment to here.\n    return !(usage \u0026\n             (wgpu::BufferUsage::Vertex | wgpu::BufferUsage::Index | wgpu::BufferUsage::Indirect));\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 96,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 97,
        "endChar": 99
      },
      "revId": "e0df4df7d866e68ebdfd9156d0a3edb333f5131a",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "37f2d4ed_412d64c6",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d11/BufferD3D11.cpp",
