      },
      "lineNbr": 291,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-17T11:59:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note: we only want to use DEFAULT usage for `MapRead` (readback cases) for now.\nI think on dedicated GPUs, using DEFAULT usage for buffers might make it slow to write on CPU. That\u0027s because the buffers might be on VRAM.\n```suggestion\n        if ((originalUsage \u0026 wgpu::BufferUsage::MapRead)\n            \u0026\u0026 CanMappableUseSingleStorage(device, originalUsage)) {\n            // If we can use DEFAULT usage for MapRead, then it\u0027s ok to add Storage usage.\n            return true;\n        }\n        // D3D11 mappable buffers cannot be used as UAV natively. So avoid that.\n        return !(originalUsage \u0026 kMappableBufferUsages);\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 287,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 291,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "e0df4df7d866e68ebdfd9156d0a3edb333f5131a",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
