        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-17T11:59:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since you already add `CPUAccessFlags` flags handling below. We can remove the redundant kMappableBufferUsages handling here.\n```suggestion\n        switch (mD3d11Usage) {\n            case D3D11_USAGE_STAGING:\n            case D3D11_USAGE_DEFAULT:\n                mMappableCopyableFlags |\u003d wgpu::BufferUsage::CopyDst;\n                break;\n            default:\n                break;\n        }\n```",
      "range": {
